{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>陪伴無數香港人成長嘅經典老字號「和興白花油」，今年踏入一百周年啦！平時講起白花油，大家可能淨係諗起陣陣熟悉嘅藥油味，今次白花油大玩跨世代回憶同本地創意，仲破格聯乘三個本地Gen-Z潮牌，將百年經典搖身一變成為潮流單品，開設全港首間為期半年嘅Pop-up店。</p><p>復古綠白霓虹打卡位 必入全新滾珠裝及Y2K限量精品</p><p>店面以品牌標誌性嘅墨綠配白色作為復古配色，結合埋霓虹燈元素，營造出既經典又新潮嘅打卡氛圍。產品方面都有驚喜，除咗大家熟悉嘅經典小瓶，仲傳承多年專業配方推出咗全新和興白花油Roll-on滾珠裝同GoodDay精油滾珠棒，打破傳統框架，日常帶出街用就更方便。店內仲會首次公開發售多款自家限量精品，例如Y2K手機掛繩、和興白花膏鑰匙圈手機掛繩、織布袋、造型公仔鎖匙扣、一百周年金裝紀念版咖啡杯、紀念版手錶系列同埋抱枕等，將品牌元素完美融入潮流生活好物。</p><figure><img alt=\"白花油 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/roll-on_20656612126ad1f618a2f3f-1024x1536.jpg\"/><figcaption>白花油 （圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/100_21367787096ad1f6451444d-1024x1280.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/tote-bag_10807789706ad1f64dde029-1024x1280.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/_-_13345255416ad1f65a16b0f-1024x1490.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/cushion_9186576526ad1f65c813e7-1024x1024.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/_-_13455047336ad1f66687b00-1024x1280.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/_14964150756ad1f66fdc761-1024x1280.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/_4390231596ad1f6765d575-1024x768.png\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>潮人必備：和興白花油 x GROCERY 限定服飾</p><p>想唔到白花油都可以著上身？今次品牌特別夥拍本地潮流服飾品牌GROCERY，以經典元素為靈感，推出一百周年限定服飾系列。整個系列將大家熟悉嘅白花油符號重新演繹，化成極具街頭風格嘅單品。款式選擇非常豐富，包括多款印花Tee、印花短版衛衣、印花衛衣、牛仔外套，甚至連帽款同手巾都有，絕對係今季必入嘅潮流單品，著出街保證回頭率極高。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/grocery-x-hoe-hin-pak-fah-yeow-archive-graphic-washed-boxy-tee_-cream2_13712678436ad1f75fb182d-1024x1536.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/grocery-x-hoe-hin-pak-fah-yeow-patch-logo-denim-chore-jacket_-mid-blue1_15644435846ad1f763a1064-1024x1536.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/grocery-x-hoe-hin-pak-fah-yeow-refreshinly-together-washed-zip-up-hoodie_-navy1_10656150616ad1f7682cc4a-1024x1536.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/groceryxhoehinpakfahyeowlogoringerbabytee_white1_3891434526ad1f76c0e257-1024x1536.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>實用生活好物 x DIY 減壓小物工作坊</p><p>除咗服飾，Pop-up店仲為大家準備咗一系列充滿香港特色嘅生活好物。今次品牌同香港原創設計品牌TEAM GREEN合作，推出一百周年限定小夜燈、磁石貼、匙扣同埋小擺設，將本土特色化作適合收藏同送禮嘅實用設計。如果你鍾意手作，就一定唔好錯過現場同香港文創品牌Pretty Useless Club合作設立嘅DIY Zone。只要喺店內購買任何產品，就可以親手拼配同製作專屬嘅Fidget減壓匙扣，有得買又有得玩，俾你嘅創意成為百周年紀念品嘅一部分。</p><figure><img alt=\"白花油 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/team-green-souvenir-collection-display_18469457316ad1f78ee733d-1024x768.png\"/><figcaption>白花油 （圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白花油 （圖片來源：官方圖片）\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/teamgreen-light-lamp_5350600186ad1f79669c55-1024x683.png\"/><figcaption>白花油 （圖片來源：官方圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:19:50.264456+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":882,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:12:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T10:57:43.446057+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:17:37.020181+00:00","content_hash":"3e7bf37317c87f487e80e31edbcc710cd1193684159d085ce6656097af76d734","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}